{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "problem": {
    "id": "oa-palantir-4",
    "courseId": "gomall",
    "lessonId": "00-overview",
    "title": "Minimize Path Value",
    "difficulty": "中等",
    "tags": [
      "OA",
      "Palantir",
      "图论",
      "最小瓶颈路径",
      "Dijkstra"
    ],
    "description": "给定一个带权无向图、起点 source 和终点 destination。路径的 stress level 是路径上边权的最大值；请找出 stress level 最小的路径。若两点不连通，返回 -1。若 source=destination，按三种固定源实现返回 0。",
    "input": "第一行 N M；接下来 M 行各为 u v w；最后一行 source destination。节点编号为 1..N。本站补充约束：1≤N≤5000，0≤M≤20000，1≤u,v,source,destination≤N，0≤w≤10^9。题源 Constraints 是损坏占位符，以上规模及非负权域为本站明示边界；没有额外要求图连通，允许平行边和自环。",
    "output": "输出一个整数：最小可能的路径最大边权；若不可达输出 -1。source=destination 时输出 0。",
    "explanation": "在图上维护从 source 出发的最小瓶颈值。扩展 u→v 时，新路径的 stress 为 max(当前 stress, w)。使用优先队列，每次确定当前瓶颈值最小的节点。",
    "hints": [
      "将路径状态定义为到达节点时的最小可能最大边权，而不是路径长度。"
    ],
    "timeLimit": 2,
    "memoryLimit": 262144,
    "outputLimit": 4096,
    "checker": "tokens",
    "languages": [
      "python",
      "go",
      "java",
      "cpp"
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "原题样例",
      "input": "4 4\n1 2 100\n2 3 200\n1 4 10\n4 3 20\n1 3\n",
      "expectedOutput": "20\n",
      "hidden": false,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "最小最大边与最小边权和路径不同",
      "input": "3 3\n1 2 8\n1 3 5\n3 2 5\n1 2\n",
      "expectedOutput": "5\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "无向边可反向通行",
      "input": "2 1\n1 2 7\n2 1\n",
      "expectedOutput": "7\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "不可达返回 -1",
      "input": "4 2\n1 2 3\n3 4 1\n1 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "-1\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "单节点起终点相同",
      "input": "1 0\n1 1\n",
      "expectedOutput": "0\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "重复边权",
      "input": "4 4\n1 2 4\n2 3 4\n3 4 4\n1 4 9\n1 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "4\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "本站权值上界",
      "input": "3 2\n1 2 1000000000\n2 3 1000000000\n1 3\n",
      "expectedOutput": "1000000000\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "零权边参与更优瓶颈路径",
      "input": "4 4\n1 2 0\n2 4 9\n1 3 4\n3 4 4\n1 4\n",
      "expectedOutput": "4\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "多个路径具有同一最优瓶颈",
      "input": "5 5\n1 2 7\n2 3 2\n3 5 7\n1 4 7\n4 5 7\n1 5\n",
      "expectedOutput": "7\n",
      "hidden": true,
      "weight": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "瓶颈权重相同的直达和多跳",
      "input": "4 4\n1 2 3\n2 3 3\n3 4 3\n1 4 3\n1 4\n",
